<title>UK: BOE forecasts 850 mln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 850 mln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 850 million stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise a repo to August 5 and an outright offers of bills maturing on or before August 5.</p>
